<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 22.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 22.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday saw 667 fixed-interest five-year bonds due on October 12, 2000 trading at 86.55 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 0.6 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
